  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: This idiot sincerely thought that this rosary would be his grace. But nothing
      came to save him.
  - speaker: 1
    text: "You see, Pilgrim, our God does not exist. What\u2019s the point of continuing
      your ascension when you realize that nothing is waiting for you in the end
      ?"
  - speaker: 0
    text: Perhaps our lord tought he would fit better next to him and thus decided
      to rush his arrival ?
  - speaker: 1
    text: Do you think this poor man deserved to be shredded ?
  - speaker: 1
    text: "If the God I once believed in allows this kind of slaughter to happen,
      I\u2019d rather not believe in him."
